{"title": "Naturally Stealthy", "pageid": 6388, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Naturally_Stealthy", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Naturally_Stealthy.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Naturally_Stealthy.webp/300px-Naturally_Stealthy.webp, /w/images/1/11/Naturally_Stealthy.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Naturally_Stealthy.webp/300px-Naturally_Stealthy.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Naturally_Stealthy.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Naturally Stealthy</b> is a passive feature available to all <a href=\"/wiki/Lightfoot_halfling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightfoot halfling\">lightfoot halflings</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your nimble nature makes you skilled at concealment. You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/25px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/38px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/50px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stealth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/25px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Lightfoot_Halfling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightfoot Halfling\">Lightfoot Halfling</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Brinna_Brightsong\" title=\"Brinna Brightsong\">Brinna Brightsong</a></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195032\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 828/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5259/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1801/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansi